    > <div class="section clearfix collection_description">
          Deliver the finest flowers <span data-sheets-value='{"1":2,"2":"bouquet"}' data-sheets-userformat='{"2":769,"3":{"1":0},"11":4,"12":0}' data-mce-fragment="1">bouquet</span> to your dearly beloved today with Flower Chimp!<br>Same-day delivery for all orders (Available for orders placed before <span data-mce-fragment="1">the cut-off time</span>)</div> <div class="quick_search"><style>
